From 5c2f98f1902c8bc7e7f5f76cd9b4939b273c9adb Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Christopher Owen <3221756+christopherowen@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 4 Nov 2026 17:24:24 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Require the producer cast and local router for
 sequence-parallel MoE

Base: candidate-39 vLLM 31412339aafdd2c1392c7294975355dbc523c5e1. The native mHC entry and TileLang router already supply this contract.

Rationale: remove BF16 gather/recast and missing-router alternatives retained for CPU stand-ins. Invalid inputs fail before any collective. CPU model simulations now supply the same cast and grouped-routing interface.

Quality: preserve the production grouped gather and routes, tensor shapes and arithmetic. Tests: targeted sequence-parallel CPU suite pending Spaceport validation; serving and GPU qualification pending.

Upstream status: local, not submitted.
